# Carnivorous Cultivator, prepared and then unprepared by casting Enroot, fetches a Mountain into the graveyard and connects on turn 5. Its trigger targets that
# Mountain, the only land card there, and Bot2 answers with Ghost Vacuum: the Mountain is exiled, so the target is illegal as the ability resolves and it does
# nothing (CR 608.2b); the Mountain is not returned to hand, and no other card is returned in its place.

